{"type":"message","id":"b456c4b4","parentId":"0a8182c8","timestamp":"2026-02-27T01:38:37.863Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-02-27 09:38 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 协调 fsrs-memory Web UI 的代码审查和修复。\n\n问题描述：网页上只，但两个牌组显示1张卡片分别显示包含4和1张卡片（逻辑错误）。\n\n请按顺序执行：\n\n1. **review-agent 任务**：\n   - 审查 /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/ 下的代码\n   - 重点检查：\n     - 卡片显示逻辑（为什么只显示1张）\n     - 牌组统计逻辑（为什么显示4和1）\n     - API 返回数据的处理\n     - 前端渲染逻辑\n   - 查找其他可能存在的逻辑错误\n   - 输出详细的审查报告\n\n2. **code-agent 任务**：\n   - 根据 review-agent 的审查报告修复问题\n   - 确保修复完整 FSRS 算法、多牌组管理、主题切换的相关问题\n\n3. **test-agent 任务**：\n   - 运行测试确保修复有效\n   - 测试 API 端点\n\n4. **重启服务**：\n   - pkill -f \"node server.js\"\n   - cd /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web && npm start\n\n5. **汇报**：\n   - 发现的问题列表\n   - 修改的文件和内容\n   - 测试结果\n   - 服务状态"}],"timestamp":1772156317860}}
{"type":"message","id":"a0c74182","parentId":"b456c4b4","timestamp":"2026-02-27T01:38:46.830Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me understand the task:\n1. I need to coordinate the code review and fix for fsrs-memory Web UI\n2. The issue: The webpage only shows 1 card, but two decks show 4 and 1 cards (logic error)\n3. I need to follow the sequence:\n   - review-agent: Review code\n   - code-agent: Fix issues\n   - test-agent: Test fixes\n   - Restart service\n   - Report results\n\nLet me start by sending a task to the review-agent to review the code.","thinkingSignature":"b7469f24cc7229eab8907e28e212733ac62b90a2e0b3a02236ba57b85ce7a803"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_m3bwkjt8vpey_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":4,"output":153,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":8185,"totalTokens":8342,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772156317862}}
