{"type":"message","id":"ec1d70c3","parentId":"0b2f92bb","timestamp":"2026-02-27T01:39:41.819Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the data better. There are:\n- 2 decks: 默认牌组 (id=1) and 日语学习 (id=2)\n- 5 cards total:\n  - Deck 1 (默认牌组): cards 1, 2, 3, 4 (4 cards)\n  - Deck 2 (日语学习): card 7 (1 card)\n\nNow I need to check what's due. The problem might be:\n1. Deck counts are correct: deck 1 has 4 cards, deck 2 has 1 card - this matches the issue\n2. But only 1 card is showing for study\n\nLet me check which cards are actually due right now:","thinkingSignature":"539fbe568cf2f462476f7c8727f681f775f354f83d0156fd6f7643a88a09aa50"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vxiycpgulvt8_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory && node -e \"\nconst db = require('better-sqlite3')('./data/cards.db');\nconst now = new Date().toISOString();\nconsole.log('Current time:', now);\nconsole.log('Due cards (all):', JSON.stringify(db.prepare(\\\"SELECT * FROM cards WHERE due_date <= ?\\\").all(now), null, 2));\nconsole.log('Due cards (deck 1):', JSON.stringify(db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards WHERE deck_id = 1 AND due_date <= ?').all(now), null, 2));\nconsole.log('Due cards (deck 2):', JSON.stringify(db.prepare('SELECT * FROM cards WHERE deck_id = 2 AND due_date <= ?').all(now), null, 2));\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":12636,"output":335,"cacheRead":7853,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20824,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772156372980}}
